it:</strong> at the southern end on the left side of the route.</li><li style='margin-bottom: 6px;'><strong>Toilet:</strong> in the northwest part of the site.</li><li style='margin-top: 10px; color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>A:</strong> rectangular area in the southwest, close to the exit</li><li style='color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>B:</strong> small rectangular area at the northeast edge of the site</li><li style='color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>C:</strong> rectangular area in the southeast, immediately east of the entrance</li><li style='color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>D:</strong> rectangular area in the northeast, between the central route and B</li><li style='color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>E:</strong> circular area in the northwest, immediately south of the toilet</li><li style='color: #0984e3; font-weight: 500;'><strong>F:</strong> rectangular area in the north-centre, above the central route</li></ul></div><div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding-left: 5px;'><div>• 18. Gallery: <span class='question-badge'>18</span> <input type='text' id='ans-18' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 19. Woodland: <span class='question-badge'>19</span> <input type='text' id='ans-19' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 20. Gift shop: <span class='question-badge'>20</span> <input type='text' id='ans-20' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div></div></div>",
